<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady. Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    53.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    46.00-50.00</p>
</text>
